Subject: [PATCH] VBA: compile If with Else after a call, Step and Property as names, numbered lines

Else ends the arguments of a call without brackets, Step and Property are
names outside their statements, numbered lines keep their own labels, With
New, !field inside With, dates with blanks and times, Enum members as
defaults, and the ordinal letters of Windows-1252 in names.
